Help me, Taya.

246
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:30,780
What's wrong?

247
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:32,100
You okay, Taya?

248
00:16:32,400 --> 00:16:33,280
Hold on.

249
00:16:33,560 --> 00:16:34,900
Listen, please.

250
00:16:36,560 --> 00:16:42,080
You must overpower my dark side at all
costs and don't worry about protecting me.

251
00:16:42,760 --> 00:16:43,720
Say what?

252
00:16:43,920 --> 00:16:45,477
You're losing your marbles, Teya.

253
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:46,437
Snap out of it.

254
00:16:46,520 --> 00:16:47,580
There's no time.

255
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:51,417
I have borrowed your friend's
body in order to reason with you.

256
00:16:51,500 --> 00:16:56,220
Destroy my evil half and let
the shadows take me. Oh no.

257
00:16:56,880 --> 00:16:58,660
Seto, what's going on?

258
00:16:59,460 --> 00:17:02,857
It appears my weak side
doesn't know when to give up.

259
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:05,920
Well, soon he'll be
out of my way for good.

260
00:17:06,120 --> 00:17:07,708
Please forgive me, Pharaoh.

261
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:12,114
My family and I were charged with
protecting your tomb until your return.

262
00:17:12,620 --> 00:17:15,260
And I always resented this task.

263
00:17:16,100 --> 00:17:19,260
So he was born as a result of my anger.

264
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:24,440
Now he must be destroyed, and
I shall go with him. Yo, what?

265
00:17:26,360 --> 00:17:27,920
Uh, is Teya home?

266
00:17:29,700 --> 00:17:31,457
What a pathetic sight.

267
00:17:31,540 --> 00:17:34,597
You've rejected the Pharaoh
for your entire life,

268
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:36,798
and now you beg for his forgiveness?

269
00:17:36,900 --> 00:17:40,160
I'm afraid it's a little
too late for that, you fool.

270
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:44,680
You've already created me, and
now your body belongs to me.

271
00:17:44,900 --> 00:17:46,780
And you barely exist.

272
00:17:47,160 --> 00:17:48,454
Just look at yourself.

273
00:17:48,840 --> 00:17:51,722
You're a mere shadow of
the person you once were.

274
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,700
You can never stop me.

275
00:17:54,040 --> 00:17:56,360
So let me finish what you started.

276
00:17:56,760 --> 00:17:58,560
She's under Merrick's control.

277
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:00,157
But she must be in there somewhere.

278
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,580
Earth to Taya!

279
00:18:01,740 --> 00:18:03,100
Merrick, don't do this!

280
00:18:04,580 --> 00:18:05,920
Please don't!

281
00:18:07,020 --> 00:18:07,880
Do what?

282
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:10,860
Surrender your own life to stop him!

283
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:15,420
Sorry, sister, but there
isn't another way. All right!

284
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:19,800
You must take down the evil force
that now controls my body, Pharaoh!

285
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:24,660
And if destroying him means
destroying me, then so be it!

286
00:18:24,980 --> 00:18:26,277
Isn't that poetic?

287
00:18:26,360 --> 00:18:31,240
My weaker self would rather be swallowed
by the shadows than see me win.

288
00:18:31,600 --> 00:18:35,100
However, I'm afraid this is
all just a waste of time.

289
00:18:35,420 --> 00:18:37,060
There's no way I can lose.

290
00:18:37,980 --> 00:18:42,640
Now then, let's get back to
your defeat, shall we? My move.

291
00:18:43,280 --> 00:18:44,560
Stand back.

292
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:49,000
Now I can bring back Monster Reborn.

293
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,660
Then Ra will follow.

294
00:18:51,120 --> 00:18:55,657
I activate the magic card,
mining for magical stones.

295
00:18:55,740 --> 00:18:57,620
That's right, Pharaoh.

296
00:18:57,960 --> 00:19:03,100
This card allows me to transfer any
magic card from my graveyard to my hand.

297
00:19:03,280 --> 00:19:06,800
And all I have to do is discard two cards.

298
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:11,040
Of course, I've chosen
this card, Monster Reborn.

299
00:19:12,740 --> 00:19:14,480
You know what's next.

300
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:19,860
In just one more turn, I'll bring
back my Winged Dragon of Ra.

301
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:24,520
I thought so, but his Egyptian
God card is impossible to destroy.

302
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:28,680
No, there's one chance
left, but it won't be easy.

303
00:19:29,100 --> 00:19:30,260
You're done!

304
00:19:30,840 --> 00:19:32,860
Victory is mine now!

305
00:19:33,440 --> 00:19:36,360
That weapon will come ultimate power!
